+        // Drive native work as well as draining it. ``js_run_stdlib_pump`` only
+        // *delivers* resolutions that are already queued; in the single-thread
+        // async model the tokio runtime that *produces* them advances here and
+        // nowhere else for a host-owned run loop. Without this line a host that
